 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids November to December came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years. In 2025 January to February ran 18% of normal on the middle, and June to July ran 165%. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 68% of normal on the middle. Grids 27450 and 27750 had their driest year in 1989, at 54% of normal.</p>"}
